[{"title":"云若筑室颜曰寄斋索诗为赋此","author":"张象津","text":"风轮转大千，一尘缘飞坠。\n坱然升降中，生物息相吹。\n遐睇尽寰宇，俯仰缅身世。\n稊粟落大瀛，狭钜两不异。\n形骸寄须臾，况又寄所寄。\n彼哉愦愦者，瑶璇起平地。\n所居仅容膝，胡为劳远致。\n深谋裕千载，展转无终既。\n会见瓦砾场，离离长秋穗。\n始藏孟尝君，终下雍门泪。\n爰有达生人，空洞无物累。\n一室羲皇前，嗒焉齐醒醉。\n而以寄名斋，谓与斋相值。\n有寄即有归，若归于何庇。\n君言归何有，神马意为辔。\n当其意尽时，万缘风云彗。\n寄无归亦无，言寄乃非伪。\n人事渺无穷，纷营无愚智。\n道术亦各出，深岩难拟议。\n孰为楚庄周，孰为鲁展季。\n援笔为赋此，略见山枢意。\n后来者谁与，勿谓斯言戏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15688,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桔槔叹","author":"张象津","text":"城中祷雨城外晴，城外祷雨赭云生。\n赭云散尽暮天碧，城外遍起桔槔声。\n桔槔彻夜声不停，判将身手与天争。\n天公仁闵覆苍生，百神司命周八纮。\n雨师唤云云不应，雷公鞭鼓鼓不鸣。\n付与桔槔自作程，桔槔非人水不行。\n鹤俯鹳啄尻首并，汗流渍与井干平。\n畦中依然水不盈，苗稀散作鱼尾赪。\n夜阑气尽声不尽，隐隐倦力相支撑。\n此时肃肃晓风清，城中达官梦初醒。\n美人素绠汲银瓶，辘轳却向雕阑听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15689,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆临朐山居","author":"张象津","text":"三载秋风劳梦魂，曾经采药入烟村。\n四山红叶客双屐，一坞白云家半门。\n宿果收完芳树老，名花开尽石床温。\n武陵旧事凭谁问，拟殖田庐长子孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15690,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜","author":"杜汉","text":"露下天气清，蟋蟀悲秋草。\n独眠感良夜，散步出林表。\n爽籁生遥空，明月惊宿鸟。\n荒寺动钟迟，寒村息镫早。\n却顾所来径，烟深人悄悄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15691,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题丹崖老人画册","author":"戈涢","text":"悬崖大石危欲裂，卧涧虬枝怒欲折。\n展卷大叫诧奇绝，先生使笔笔屈铁。\n却下前溪势渐平，蒙茸芳草被堤生。\n有人负手逍遥立，上有黄鹂深树鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15692,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"眼镜分韵得可字","author":"戈涢","text":"少年观书如观火，偏傍点画推细琐。\n年老双目渐昏眊，睻目空花飞朵朵。\n临池未写意已疲，展卷欲诵眉先锁。\n叆叇何物乃尔神，能使精力还故我。\n两片轻冰彻底明，满轮蟾影凌虚堕。\n鲁鱼豕亥辨毫釐，大似燃犀走轻舸。\n朝朝铅椠那辞劳，夜夜校仇犹自果。\n我笑杜陵对佳节，看花常愁雾中坐。\n又笑东坡观细字，向龙乞水计何左。\n至宝无由持赠之，若令一见应许可。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15693,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扑满分韵得复字","author":"戈涢","text":"空其中，硕其腹，以瓦为之代箧椟。\n上开狭孔容一钱，鬻向儿曹作私蓄。\n入窍虽易出窍难，抱持把玩从翻覆。\n不劳费扃钥，不须防厮仆。\n但嗟器易盈，满便遭敲扑。\n锵然一掷落纷纷，青蚨遍地如撒菽。\n黄童快意白叟笑，终岁积来不盈掬。\n金穴底深深，铜山高矗矗。\n既足遗子孙，兼之瞻亲族。\n戋戋能几何，曾不给饘粥。\n小儿作计良足嗤，壮夫谋生虑宜熟。\n我曾四方事奔走，蝇头也共人逐逐。\n囊漏宁余润笔资，舌耕讵有逢年福。\n当时误信太白言，千金散尽还来复。\n人生由命匪由他，韩子至论今方服。\n枉羡金满籯，空买愁千斛。\n宁甘壁立贫，不效穷途哭。\n万卷从来敌百城，且收残编充败簏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15694,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阻雨宝田家","author":"戈涢","text":"相对话淫潦，愁阴何日开。\n惊闻茶鼎沸，又道雨声来。\n屋避床床漏，阶封步步苔。\n农家方望岁，妇子倍增哀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15695,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"井陉道中山色甚佳前游未之奇也","author":"戈涢","text":"昔畏井陉道，乱石如猛虎。\n今爱井陉山，遥峰如静女。\n前岁与今岁，所历非有殊。\n今乃下心意，昔但忧驰驱。\n譬如读异书，聱牙初不免。\n既深遂忘疲，文奥义自显。\n紫翠非一状，烟峦逾千重。\n延绵不可极，转转相为容。\n是岁秋雨足，宿麦有万亩。\n环山一剪齐，绿若春初韭。\n既以增妩媚，弥用清心神。\n又如画功妙，设色多于皴。\n翻恨迫长途，不得恣幽讨。\n何当万峰巅，一览群山小。\n同行无朋侣，谁与赏此奇。\n顾笑语僮仆，顽石亦解颐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15696,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桃花岩","author":"王旒","text":"几回立马望清晖，才得攀萝入翠微。\n一代客随流水去，三春梦逐落花飞。\n云山西拥峰峦尽，烟壑东开草树稀。\n我欲诛茅分片石，蹉跎不觉素心违。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15697,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠椿亭侍郎 其一","author":"福康安","text":"城南韦杜甲门高，垂老论文意气豪。\n记否朝回花底宴，酒痕犹渍旧宫袍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15698,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠椿亭侍郎 其二","author":"福康安","text":"少年许国两心同，紫陌红尘并玉骢。\n无那天风分雁序，君行西塞我辽东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15699,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠椿亭侍郎 其三","author":"福康安","text":"龙沙万里怅离群，自此参辰宦迹分。\n料得天涯劳远梦，滇风蜀雪又秦云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15700,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠椿亭侍郎 其四","author":"福康安","text":"几番剖鲤得琼章，昔款今情尔许长。\n最是关心笺尾句，万金书属寄高堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15701,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠椿亭侍郎 其五","author":"福康安","text":"昨年沙碛冲寒去，镜海冰花衬马蹄。\n手把鞭梢指葱岭，故人还在岭云西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15702,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠椿亭侍郎 其六","author":"福康安","text":"华发扶鸠盼早归，寸心藉可报春晖。\n承欢岁月皆君赐，五色宫袍绚舞衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15703,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠椿亭侍郎 其七","author":"福康安","text":"忽忽飙轮倏九年，而今才见使星旋。\n入关定远头还黑，偻指旌旄过酒泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15704,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠椿亭侍郎 其八","author":"福康安","text":"句写相思附尺函，殷勤遣使迓征骖。\n兰山未把平原酒，先抵西窗一夕谭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15705,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西招四时吟 其一","author":"和琳","text":"莫讶春来后，寒威倍胜前。\n小窗欣日色，大漠渺人烟。\n风怒沙能语，山危雪弄权。\n略应桃柳意，塞上怯争妍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15706,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西招四时吟 其二","author":"和琳","text":"山阳四五月，嫩绿渐生生。\n草老刚盈寸，花稀不识名。\n开窗纨扇废，挟纩纻罗轻。\n树有浓阴处，都翻纮索声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15707,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西招四时吟 其三","author":"和琳","text":"南山看雾起，雷为雨吹嘘。\n淡淡秋无迹，淙淙夜不虚。\n池塘堪浴佛，稞麦渐仓储。\n更喜羊脂厚，厨供大嚼初。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15708,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西招四时吟 其四","author":"和琳","text":"木炭供来日，陂塘半涸冰。\n草枯归牧马，寒重敛飞蝇。\n沙渍衣多垢，山童雪不凝。\n客游闲戏笔，真个悟三乘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15709,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晴野望","author":"丰绅殷德","text":"西山积雪消，霁色散平楚。\n微风扇淑气，闲云澹容与。\n溪流春涨主，历历鱼堪数。\n悠扬远寺钟，掩映隔村树。\n翠壁倚高寒，晴霞横一缕。\n阳阿花欲绽，幽涧禽交语。\n羡彼山中居，遐观独延伫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15710,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓起望诸峰积雪口占一绝","author":"丰绅殷德","text":"晓瞻积素遍巉岏，缥缈云封十八盘。\n我欲乘风超汗漫，遥知高处不胜寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15711,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔人再觅桃花源不得路忆隐者","author":"孔庆镕","text":"一舟重破绿溪烟，风景依稀别有天。\n路转峰回非旧迹，水光山色认前缘。\n昨宵鸡酒还疑梦，此景苍茫似隔年。\n满地落花人怅望，白云深锁夕阳边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15712,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游西山","author":"富明安","text":"倦游余兴在，归路踏残阳。\n花发青林外，人行绿水傍。\n落霞城堞隐，芳草马蹄香。\n即景须行乐，何妨作酒狂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15713,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日道中寄丁星墅","author":"李奉翰","text":"乍见江枫叶已丹，偶然别绪上眉端。\n秋花小阁人欹枕，疏柳长堤我据鞍。\n雁影云随天际远，潮声风送晚来寒。\n未残丛菊还宜醉，好把新篇寄与看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15714,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日江行","author":"李奉翰","text":"篷窗心迹羡沙鸥，几处疏林映玉钩。\n柔橹声中黄叶冷，奚囊载得一江秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15715,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访钱箨石阁学留坐四照楼却赋一律即呈箨石","author":"胡季堂","text":"携手同登四照楼，湖山面面坐中收。\n济流起伏来千里，岱岳峥嵘压二州。\n过眼烟云凭去住，到庭风月任勾留。\n从知学士多豪兴，把盏敲诗醉不休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15716,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历下亭","author":"胡季堂","text":"久闻历下亭名古，今识亭窗向水开。\n恬静湖光归几席，翠微山色入追陪。\n一城砧杵秋声远，几处蒹葭野岸隈。\n莫道终宵人迹少，涵虚应有夜珠来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15717,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜宿紫阳宫听瀑","author":"玉德","text":"不辨风声是雨声，松涛瀑布枕边生。\n空山大谷鸣金铁，威壮元戎万马行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15718,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沛翁以樽酒见惠赋谢","author":"景安","text":"西风吹鬓冷，凉月入怀虚。\n树杪秋声寄，篱边菊影疏。\n饮缘无酒戒，病岂仗医除。\n开瓮欣何以，陶然醉有余。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15719,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿阳道中","author":"景安","text":"山程逐日入清幽，涧水潺潺漱石流。\n欲问关情何处是，半林红叶写深秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15720,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋前一夜作","author":"景安","text":"梧桐移月影移扉，银汉迢迢夜漏稀。\n古驿三更人未卧，碧天一字雁初归。\n病躯不为闲愁瘦，诗橐偏因秋色肥。\n白发萧萧过半世，恍如蝶梦恋花飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15721,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"淮阴怀古","author":"毓奇","text":"重城虎踞镇淮流，绕郭帆樯日夜浮。\n漂母荒祠花草艳，枚皋旧宅燕莺留。\n五王戈甲争南渡，六代英雄据上游。\n往事销沈形胜在，空教极目海天秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15722,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"午日邀赵耘松观察暨惕庄晴岚小集次耘松韵","author":"毓奇","text":"廿年旧雨此重亲，卮酒宁辞一再巡。\n往事休惊嘶阵马，清歌喜对倚楼人。\n平蛮经济留声远，课士文章报国均。\n畅好竹西风雅地，欧苏千古共昏晨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15723,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同人小集晓岚宗伯归途成诗次韵","author":"韩鑅","text":"词锋料拣必精英，隔岁惭余句始成。\n形迹都忘新旧雨，谈谐自见古今情。\n青樽恰借轻风送，白袷偏宜澹月明。\n欣际太平无一事，会联真率过余生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15724,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"何日山中住","author":"江春","text":"何日山中住，山中我旧知。\n茅堂深竹里，螺径夕阳时。\n黄蝶穿篱疾，闲云出岫迟。\n今朝对明镜，愁见发成丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15725,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹屋","author":"江春","text":"曲廊暗接隐斜阑，数卷闲书一画竿。\n不是种花先种竹，爱他时作雨声寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15726,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登泰山 其一","author":"江春","text":"白云出其下，终古泰山青。\n到地盘珠馆，扪天叠翠屏。\n明禋尊岳渎，封禅配云亭。\n齐鲁峰无数，苍苍入杳冥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15727,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登泰山 其二","author":"江春","text":"直上高无极，横空十八盘。\n树传秦帝爵，云护汉皇坛。\n俯瞰东山小，平临北斗寒。\n遥知沧海上，一气走双丸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15728,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宏证庵避雨","author":"汤懋纲","text":"重云压翠微，秋林响不定。\n洒洒飞雨来，寻行入幽径。\n室静凝清香，堂虚应孤磬。\n目从寂灭观，耳向虚无听。\n茶熟话三乘，发余禅悦性。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15729,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀","author":"汤懋纲","text":"井梧飘叶后，众树声恻恻。\n未即伤凋零，已暗销精力。\n野客赏丹黄，谓胜春花色。\n入林岂不佳，抚怀增太息。\n衰境谅如斯，渐有寒霜逼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15730,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日杂兴 其一","author":"汤懋纲","text":"疏放难违性，苔荒野巷深。\n到门黄叶雨，隐几白云心。\n但使胜三雅，何劳戏五禽。\n吾生原不系，众累亦徒侵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15731,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日杂兴 其二","author":"汤懋纲","text":"过眼忘牵滞，随心泯怨憎。\n青山良有意，白发岂无能。\n岭首云门杖，林腰佛屋镫。\n抛踪外尘事，此兴独堪乘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15732,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日杂兴 其三","author":"汤懋纲","text":"童爇乌薪暖，垂帘向客论。\n老怀唯近古，学究不妨村。\n岂务藏崖穴，甘输倚市门。\n约探梅信去，霜晓或烟昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15733,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日杂兴 其四","author":"汤懋纲","text":"遮户渔罾罢，溪山静有情。\n树梢烟际簇，鸥背日边明。\n俗自浓新态，人谁责旧盟。\n荒园存古柏，却与抱孤清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15734,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日雨中集东皋姚王祠","author":"汤懋纲","text":"满目秋阴菊尚迟，佳辰还起昔人思。\n漫愁风雨潘邠老，须纵登临杜牧之。\n山郭云昏潮落后，湖天烟冷雁飞时。\n陂陀路转千林表，乐岁笙镛赛古祠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15735,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"对凯头陀旧画有感","author":"伊嵩阿","text":"展卷犹怜古墨香，思君颜色转苍茫。\n空余指下青山老，不见樽前白发狂。\n几度云烟伤过眼，六年风雨想连床。\n头陀撩脚归何处，定向虚无觅故乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15736,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石机栈","author":"夏宗澜","text":"石机之栈何其高，湘流急去浮金鳌。\n长松历落荫云日，天风一吼生秋涛。\n下有深谷最幽绝，六月炎蒸常积雪。\n浑疑巨灵开笑口，一望惊心更挢舌。\n悬厓直俯冯夷宫，周遭怪石多玲珑。\n射来是虎缠苔碧，叱处成羊蚀藓红。\n我生素负登山癖，每遇高峰频蜡屐。\n独有兹山不可攀，欲上先愁无羽翼。\n安得五日画石手，遣向石矶壁上走。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15737,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金州道中","author":"夏宗澜","text":"此处溪山好，遨游岂偶然。\n奇峰盘曲涧，怪石漱流泉。\n白漾空中瀑，青窥洞里天。\n磨厓堪作记，绝似语溪边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15738,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"至柳城界远望乌蛮山","author":"夏宗澜","text":"山色乌蛮近柳城，扁舟夜泊梦还惊。\n渔镫明灭飞萤坠，人语钩辀老鹳鸣。\n险绝关门都号鬼，苍然草木尚疑兵。\n荒江一望人烟杳，杜宇休啼已泪倾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15739,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜坐无隐庐","author":"曹锡黼","text":"夜气澄如水，西风雨后凉。\n坐知庐可爱，径与世相忘。\n人静虫吟壁，窗虚月到床。\n萧然何所寄，满院足秋香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15740,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新秋夜雨","author":"侯日曦","text":"散步闲阶下，重门闭夕阴。\n向人寒烛尽，带雨夜钟深。\n流水从他事，泊云任此心。\n世情何处淡，潇洒发长吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15741,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桂林即事","author":"刘大观","text":"白云长护孔明台，台上扶桑花自开。\n一夕东风天骤暖，梧州已送荔支来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15742,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"得张庐峰消息","author":"刘大观","text":"胥江一棹暮云疏，心似蛩蛩失駏驉。\n正苦春愁难自遣，海风吹到故人书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15743,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读王先生猷定四照堂诗书后","author":"刘大观","text":"西江诗派本然清，造句还如玉琢成。\n百怪盘胸能匠物，孤岑晦迹恐沽名。\n博桑日影桃花寺，韎韐风涛铁瓮城。\n目断长湖人渐老，黄冠麦饭独关情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15744,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题唐毓东仿倪高士秋林图","author":"陈绳祖","text":"惜墨如金不盈纸，画师惟有倪高士。\n别开生面写山林，肯使春风竞桃李。\n形相脱略畦径出，木石与居真色起。\n有如老僧坐荒谷，万籁无声心若死。\n苍茫东绢静有余，后来学者何纷挈。\n略如取士得皮相，遗其精者存其粗。\n先生神妙本天性，狷介已号当时迂。\n强舒俗手求貌似，直以燕石矜璠玙。\n此幅神完气逾古，经营已见良工苦。\n烛灺香残酒盏空，老郎自向厨头取。\n忽云尾白待题识，今雨不来来旧雨。\n瓶花老屋冰雪深，数盆败菊横焦琴。\n绝无炉火相暖热，但觉夜气寒森森。\n画图亦洗脂粉罄，与人与屋皆相近。\n况是元冬百物枯，庭前树石还相证。\n我亦有心如槁木，未敢重偷升斗禄。\n慭留诗债入新正，偿君自挂瓶花屋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15745,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明霞墓","author":"陈绳祖","text":"小碣明霞葬北山，魂归犹自泪潺湲。\n澄湖月落开妆镜，修竹风铿隐佩环。\n慧业难消天意妒，风情须待老来删。\n春林自洒啼鹃血，肠断游人日往还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15746,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自上津赴边界防堵宿槐树沟口题壁","author":"觉罗恒庆","text":"默祝烽烟靖，书生学掌兵。\n深山秋试马，细雨晚屯营。\n令易千军肃，诗难五字精。\n溪流喧子夜，不寐听鸡声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15747,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜山行","author":"张裕谷","text":"秋月何皎皎，秋山自悄悄。\n黄叶彫青溪，凉风飞白鸟。\n山中行役人，尘襟涤清晓。\n忽闻烟寺钟，铿然出林表。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15748,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日感怀","author":"张裕谷","text":"刺桐花老紫萸香，又听宾鸿唳早霜。\n沙草寒依秋火白，瘴云低压夕阳黄。\n城头钟鼓初逢夜，村落人家未涤场。\n好煞蛮歌清月下，不须镫火照河梁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":15749,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]